-## Optional Dependencies
+## Constant Date Arithmetic
 
-SQLGlot uses [dateutil](https://github.com/dateutil/dateutil) to simplify constant date and interval arithmetic. With dateutil installed, the optimizer simplifies:
+The optimizer simplifies constant date and interval arithmetic, using only the standard library:
 
 ```sql
 DATE '2021-01-01' + INTERVAL '1' MONTH
 ```
 
-to:
+becomes:
 
 ```sql
 CAST('2021-02-01' AS DATE)
 ```
 
-Without dateutil, the optimizer leaves this arithmetic unevaluated.
+Month and year steps keep the day of the month, clamped to the month's last day, so
+`DATE '2021-01-31' + INTERVAL '1' MONTH` becomes `CAST('2021-02-28' AS DATE)`.
 
